OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785772101
OL,3,CBritish father charged over son's
OL,4,Cdeath in Cyprus allowed to go home for
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FA British father charged with
OL,8,Fnegligence over the death of his three-
OL,9,Fyear-old son in Cyprus has been told
OL,10,Fhe can fly home to attend the funeral.
OL,12,FThe 37-year-old man, who has not yet
OL,13,Fbeen identified, is expected to fly
OL,14,Fhome on Wednesday.
OL,16,FHis lawyer, Alexandros Alexandrou,
OL,17,Fsaid the court lifted all travel
OL,18,Frestrictions imposed on his client for
OL,19,Fa month.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/3
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
