FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785772101
OL,3,CBritish father charged over son's
OL,4,Cdeath in Cyprus allowed to go home for
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FThe order expires September 15 when
OL,8,Fthe 37-year-old man is due back in
OL,9,FCyprus to answer charges against him.
OL,10,FIf he doesn't return on that date, a
OL,11,FEuropean arrest warrant will be issued
OL,12,Fagainst him, Alexandrou said.
OL,14,FThe man and his family were reportedly
OL,15,Fjust a few days into a holiday in the
OL,16,FCypriot resort town of Paphos last
OL,17,Fmonth when his son fell from a fourth-
OL,18,Ffloor hotel window. The circumstances
OL,19,Fof the fall remain unclear.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/3
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
