FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785772101
OL,3,CBritish father charged over son's
OL,4,Cdeath in Cyprus allowed to go home for
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FThe man was arrested and charged, but
OL,8,Fa court later released him from
OL,9,Fcustody on the condition that he
OL,10,Fsurrender his passport, report to a
OL,11,Fpolice station weekly and pay a
OL,12,FE20,000 (around #17,100) bond.
OL,14,FWhilst in the UK, the 37-year-old will
OL,15,Falso complete paperwork in relation to
OL,16,Fthe death of his child.
